      "writtenOn": "2024-09-11T20:22:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My gut feeling is we shouldn\u0027t have any `\u003dy`\u0027s unless it is already `\u003dy` in either:\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/h/android/kernel/common/+/android15-6.6:arch/x86/configs/gki_defconfig\nor\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/h/android/kernel/common/+/android15-6.6:arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig\n\nUnless we have a plan to get it added to the `gki_defconfig` which would apply to all Android devices (including ones not running Android Desktop).",
      "parentUuid": "e1d60378_3e2b7cf4",
      "revId": "6abe463849f39639df03df61b1052d6bcbdd29e9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
